# sabotage=PassesDropCalls: behind the pass a call of an unknown function is gone. The pass turns a tail call of the function itself into a jump, and answers for that call alone: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass EliminateTailRecursion
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-beside-a-tail-call-and-a-generator-left-alone.ir
